  {
   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Text Rotate\n\nA fixed phrase followed by a pill that cycles through a list of words: the old word's letters slide up and out, the pill springs to the new width and the next word's letters rise in, with a staggered wave.\n\nCategory: typography. Length: 8 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A headline has a fixed lead-in and one slot that cycles through short words (\"Make it ... fast / fun / right\").\n- The slot sits in a pill or badge that should resize smoothly to each new word.\n\nAvoid when:\n- Words should roll like a slot machine with blur: use inline-word-roll or slot-machine-roll.\n- The text should be longer than a few words per step.\n\nVariables:\n- prefix (string): Prefix, default \"Make it\"\n- texts (string): Words, default \"work!|fancy|right|fast|fun\"\n- font_size (number, 24-300): Font size, default 110\n- font_weight (enum): Font weight, default \"400\"\n- color (color): Prefix color, default \"#171717\"\n- pill_color (color): Pill color, default \"#ff3b30\"\n- pill_text_color (color): Pill text color, default \"#ffffff\"\n- split_by (enum): Split by, default \"characters\"\n- interval (number, 0.8-6): Interval, default 1.6\n- stagger (number, 0-0.3): Stagger, default 0.025\n- stagger_from (enum): Stagger from, default \"last\"\n- stiffness (number, 50-900): Stiffness, default 400\n- damping (number, 5-80): Damping, default 30\n\nSource: https://github.com/danielpetho/fancy. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
  {
   "path": "scene.html",
   "role": "source",
   "content": "<!doctype html>\n<!--\n  Text Rotate\n\n  A fixed phrase followed by a pill that cycles through a list of words: the old word's letters slide up and out, the pill springs to the new width and the next word's letters rise in, with a staggered wave.\n\n  Ported to an HTML + GSAP sub-composition by usemosio/blocks from:\n  https://github.com/danielpetho/fancy/blob/f9f62c61207b2dd3210476dd98af3c9a5be24094/src/fancy/components/text/text-rotate.tsx\n\n  MIT License\n\n  Copyright (c) 2024 Daniel Petho\n\n  Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy\n  of this software and associated documentation files (the \"Software\"), to deal\n  in the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights\n  to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell\n  copies of the Software, and to permit persons to whom the Software is\n  furnished to do so, subject to the following conditions:\n\n  The above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be included in all\n  copies or substantial portions of the Software.\n\n  THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED \"AS IS\", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR\n  IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,\n  FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE\n  AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER\n  LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM,\n  OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE\n  SOFTWARE.\n-->\n<html\n  lang=\"en\"\n  data-composition-id=\"text-rotate\"\n  data-composition-duration=\"8\"\n  data-composition-variables='[\n    {\"id\": \"prefix\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Prefix\", \"description\": \"Fixed text before the rotating word.\", \"default\": \"Make it\"},\n    {\"id\": \"texts\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Words\", \"description\": \"Words that rotate, separated by a vertical bar.\", \"default\": \"work!|fancy|right|fast|fun\"},\n    {\"id\": \"font_size\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Font size\", \"description\": \"Maximum text size in pixels. A long line shrinks to fit the frame.\", \"default\": 110, \"min\": 24, \"max\": 300, \"step\": 1, \"unit\": \"px\"},\n    {\"id\": \"font_weight\", \"type\": \"enum\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Font weight\", \"description\": \"Weight of the text.\", \"default\": \"400\", \"options\": [{\"value\": \"300\", \"label\": \"Light\"}, {\"value\": \"400\", \"label\": \"Regular\"}, {\"value\": \"500\", \"label\": \"Medium\"}, {\"value\": \"600\", \"label\": \"Semibold\"}, {\"value\": \"700\", \"label\": \"Bold\"}]},\n    {\"id\": \"color\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Prefix color\", \"description\": \"Color of the fixed text.\", \"default\": \"#171717\"},\n    {\"id\": \"pill_color\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Pill color\", \"description\": \"Background of the rotating word.\", \"default\": \"#ff3b30\"},\n    {\"id\": \"pill_text_color\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Pill text color\", \"description\": \"Color of the rotating word.\", \"default\": \"#ffffff\"},\n    {\"id\": \"split_by\", \"type\": \"enum\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Split by\", \"description\": \"Whether letters or whole words move as one.\", \"default\": \"characters\", \"options\": [{\"value\": \"characters\", \"label\": \"Characters\"}, {\"value\": \"words\", \"label\": \"Words\"}]},\n    {\"id\": \"interval\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Interval\", \"description\": \"Seconds each word is on screen, from the start of one swap to the next.\", \"default\": 1.6, \"min\": 0.8, \"max\": 6, \"step\": 0.1, \"unit\": \"s\"},\n    {\"id\": \"stagger\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Stagger\", \"description\": \"Seconds between neighbouring letters.\", \"default\": 0.025, \"min\": 0, \"max\": 0.3, \"step\": 0.005, \"unit\": \"s\"},\n    {\"id\": \"stagger_from\", \"type\": \"enum\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Stagger from\", \"description\": \"Where the wave of letters starts.\", \"default\": \"last\", \"options\": [{\"value\": \"first\", \"label\": \"First letter\"}, {\"value\": \"last\", \"label\": \"Last letter\"}, {\"value\": \"center\", \"label\": \"Center\"}, {\"value\": \"random\", \"label\": \"Random\"}]},\n    {\"id\": \"stiffness\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Stiffness\", \"description\": \"Spring stiffness of the movement.\", \"default\": 400, \"min\": 50, \"max\": 900, \"step\": 10},\n    {\"id\": \"damping\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Damping\", \"description\": \"Spring damping of the movement.\", \"default\": 30, \"min\": 5, \"max\": 80, \"step\": 1}\n  ]'\n>\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <title>Text Rotate</title>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <template>\n      <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;display=block\" />\n      <style>\n        #root {\n          position: absolute;\n          inset: 0;\n          overflow: hidden;\n          container-type: size;\n          pointer-events: none;\n        }\n        #root { color: #171717; font-family: Geist, system-ui, sans-serif; }\n        .tr-stage { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }\n        .tr-row { display: flex; align-items: center; white-space: pre; line-height: 1.2; }\n        .tr-pill { position: relative; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 0.22em; display: block; margin-left: 0.05em; }\n        .tr-sizer { display: block; visibility: hidden; padding: 0.06em 0.3em 0.12em; white-space: pre; width: 0; }\n        .tr-layer { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 0; transform: translateX(-50%); width: max-content; display: flex; white-space: pre; padding: 0.06em 0 0.12em; }\n        .tr-word { display: inline-flex; overflow: hidden; padding-bottom: 0.1em; margin-bottom: -0.1em; }\n        .tr-ch { display: inline-block; white-space: pre; }\n      </style>\n\n      <div id=\"root\" data-composition-id=\"text-rotate\" data-duration=\"8\" data-fps=\"30\">\n        <div id=\"tr-clip\" class=\"tr-stage clip\" data-start=\"0\" data-duration=\"8\" data-track-index=\"0\">\n          <div id=\"tr-row\" class=\"tr-row\"><span id=\"tr-prefix\"></span><span id=\"tr-pill\" class=\"tr-pill\"><span class=\"tr-sizer\">&nbsp;</span></span></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/CustomEase.min.js\"></script>\n        <script>\n          (function () {\n            \"use strict\";\n\n            var DEFS = [{\"id\": \"prefix\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Prefix\", \"description\": \"Fixed text before the rotating word.\", \"default\": \"Make it\"}, {\"id\": \"texts\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Words\", \"description\": \"Words that rotate, separated by a vertical bar.\", \"default\": \"work!|fancy|right|fast|fun\"}, {\"id\": \"font_size\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Font size\", \"description\": \"Maximum text size in pixels. A long line shrinks to fit the frame.\", \"default\": 110, \"min\": 24, \"max\": 300, \"step\": 1, \"unit\": \"px\"}, {\"id\": \"font_weight\", \"type\": \"enum\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Font weight\", \"description\": \"Weight of the text.\", \"default\": \"400\", \"options\": [{\"value\": \"300\", \"label\": \"Light\"}, {\"value\": \"400\", \"label\": \"Regular\"}, {\"value\": \"500\", \"label\": \"Medium\"}, {\"value\": \"600\", \"label\": \"Semibold\"}, {\"value\": \"700\", \"label\": \"Bold\"}]}, {\"id\": \"color\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Prefix color\", \"description\": \"Color of the fixed text.\", \"default\": \"#171717\"}, {\"id\": \"pill_color\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Pill color\", \"description\": \"Background of the rotating word.\", \"default\": \"#ff3b30\"}, {\"id\": \"pill_text_color\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Pill text color\", \"description\": \"Color of the rotating word.\", \"default\": \"#ffffff\"}, {\"id\": \"split_by\", \"type\": \"enum\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Split by\", \"description\": \"Whether letters or whole words move as one.\", \"default\": \"characters\", \"options\": [{\"value\": \"characters\", \"label\": \"Characters\"}, {\"value\": \"words\", \"label\": \"Words\"}]}, {\"id\": \"interval\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Interval\", \"description\": \"Seconds each word is on screen, from the start of one swap to the next.\", \"default\": 1.6, \"min\": 0.8, \"max\": 6, \"step\": 0.1, \"unit\": \"s\"}, {\"id\": \"stagger\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Stagger\", \"description\": \"Seconds between neighbouring letters.\", \"default\": 0.025, \"min\": 0, \"max\": 0.3, \"step\": 0.005, \"unit\": \"s\"}, {\"id\": \"stagger_from\", \"type\": \"enum\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Stagger from\", \"description\": \"Where the wave of letters starts.\", \"default\": \"last\", \"options\": [{\"value\": \"first\", \"label\": \"First letter\"}, {\"value\": \"last\", \"label\": \"Last letter\"}, {\"value\": \"center\", \"label\": \"Center\"}, {\"value\": \"random\", \"label\": \"Random\"}]}, {\"id\": \"stiffness\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Stiffness\", \"description\": \"Spring stiffness of the movement.\", \"default\": 400, \"min\": 50, \"max\": 900, \"step\": 10}, {\"id\": \"damping\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Damping\", \"description\": \"Spring damping of the movement.\", \"default\": 30, \"min\": 5, \"max\": 80, \"step\": 1}];\n            var root = document.getElementById(\"root\");\n            var raw = window.__hyperframes && window.__hyperframes.getVariables ? window.__hyperframes.getVariables() : {};\n            var D = parseFloat(root.dataset.duration || \"8\");\n            function V(id) {\n              var d = null;\n              for (var i = 0; i < DEFS.length; i++) if (DEFS[i].id === id) d = DEFS[i];\n              var v = raw[id];\n              if (v === undefined || v === null || (v === \"\" && d.type !== \"string\")) return d.default;\n              if (d.type === \"number\") { var n = Number(v); return Number.isFinite(n) ? Math.min(d.max, Math.max(d.min, n)) : d.default; }\n              if (d.type === \"boolean\") return v === true || v === \"true\";\n              if (d.type === \"enum\") { for (var j = 0; j < d.options.length; j++) if (String(d.options[j].value) === String(v)) return d.options[j].value; return d.default; }\n              if (d.type === \"string\") return typeof v === \"string\" ? v : d.default;\n              return typeof v === \"string\" && v ? v : d.default;\n            }\n            function mulberry32(a) { return function () { a |= 0; a = (a + 0x6d2b79f5) | 0; var t = Math.imul(a ^ (a >>> 15), 1 | a); t = (t + Math.imul(t ^ (t >>> 7), 61 | t)) ^ t; return ((t ^ (t >>> 14)) >>> 0) / 4294967296; }; }\n            function hash3(a, b, c) { return mulberry32((a * 7919 + b * 104729 + c * 1299709) | 0)(); }\n            // Stagger delays in seconds: \"first\", \"last\", \"center\", \"random\" (seeded shuffle) or an index.\n            function stagger(n, from, step, seed) {\n              var out = [], i;\n              if (from === \"random\") {\n                var rng = mulberry32(seed || 7), idx = [];\n                for (i = 0; i < n; i++) idx.push(i);\n                for (i = n - 1; i > 0; i--) { var j = Math.floor(rng() * (i + 1)); var tmp = idx[i]; idx[i] = idx[j]; idx[j] = tmp; }\n                for (i = 0; i < n; i++) out[idx[i]] = i * step;\n                return out;\n              }\n              for (i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n                var k = from === \"last\" ? n - 1 - i : from === \"center\" ? Math.abs(Math.floor(n / 2) - i) : typeof from === \"number\" ? Math.abs(from - i) : i;\n                out.push(k * step);\n              }\n              return out;\n            }\n            // Damped spring from 0 to 1 (stiffness/damping/mass or duration/bounce, as Motion defines them).\n            function spring(o) {\n              var m = o.mass || 1, k, c;\n              if (o.duration !== undefined) { var w = (2 * Math.PI) / o.duration; k = w * w * m; c = 2 * (1 - (o.bounce || 0)) * Math.sqrt(k * m); }\n              else { k = o.stiffness; c = o.damping; }\n              var w0 = Math.sqrt(k / m), z = c / (2 * Math.sqrt(k * m));\n              function at(t) {\n                if (t <= 0) return 0;\n                if (Math.abs(z - 1) < 1e-6) return 1 - Math.exp(-w0 * t) * (1 + w0 * t);\n                if (z < 1) { var wd = w0 * Math.sqrt(1 - z * z); return 1 - Math.exp(-z * w0 * t) * (Math.cos(wd * t) + ((z * w0) / wd) * Math.sin(wd * t)); }\n                var s = Math.sqrt(z * z - 1), r1 = -w0 * (z - s), r2 = -w0 * (z + s);\n                return 1 - (r2 * Math.exp(r1 * t) - r1 * Math.exp(r2 * t)) / (r2 - r1);\n              }\n              var settle = 6;\n              for (var t = 0.02; t < 6; t += 0.02) {\n                var ok = true;\n                for (var u = t; u < Math.min(t + 0.3, 6); u += 0.05) if (Math.abs(1 - at(u)) > 0.002) { ok = false; break; }\n                if (ok) { settle = t; break; }\n              }\n              return { at: at, duration: settle };\n            }\n            function fitText(text) { return Array.from(text); }\n\n            var row = document.getElementById(\"tr-row\"), pill = document.getElementById(\"tr-pill\");\n            var prefix = V(\"prefix\");\n            document.getElementById(\"tr-prefix\").textContent = prefix ? prefix + \" \" : \"\";\n            var texts = String(V(\"texts\")).split(\"|\").map(function (s) { return s.trim(); }).filter(Boolean);\n            if (!texts.length) texts = [\"work!\"];\n            var maxLen = prefix.length + 1;\n            var longest = 0; texts.forEach(function (s) { longest = Math.max(longest, Array.from(s).length); });\n            row.style.fontSize = \"min(\" + V(\"font_size\") + \"px, calc(86cqw / \" + ((maxLen + longest + 1) * 0.56).toFixed(2) + \"))\";\n            row.style.fontWeight = V(\"font_weight\"); row.style.color = V(\"color\");\n            pill.style.background = V(\"pill_color\"); pill.style.color = V(\"pill_text_color\");\n            var splitChars = V(\"split_by\") === \"characters\";\n            var padEm = 0.3;\n            var sp = spring({ stiffness: V(\"stiffness\"), damping: V(\"damping\") });\n            var layers = texts.map(function (s, k) {\n              var layer = document.createElement(\"span\"); layer.className = \"tr-layer\"; layer.id = \"tr-layer-\" + k;\n              var units = [], words = s.split(\" \");\n              words.forEach(function (w, wi) {\n                var ww = document.createElement(\"span\"); ww.className = \"tr-word\";\n                (splitChars ? fitText(w) : [w]).forEach(function (ch) {\n                  var c = document.createElement(\"span\"); c.className = \"tr-ch\"; c.textContent = ch; ww.appendChild(c); units.push(c);\n                });\n                layer.appendChild(ww);\n                if (wi < words.length - 1) { var sps = document.createElement(\"span\"); sps.className = \"tr-ch\"; sps.textContent = \" \"; layer.appendChild(sps); }\n              });\n              pill.appendChild(layer);\n              return { el: layer, units: units, delays: stagger(units.length, V(\"stagger_from\"), V(\"stagger\"), 5 + k) };\n            });\n            var interval = V(\"interval\"), n = texts.length;\n            function widthOf(k) { return layers[k].el.offsetWidth + 2 * padEm * parseFloat(getComputedStyle(row).fontSize); }\n            function maxDelay(k) { return Math.max.apply(null, layers[k].delays.concat([0])); }\n            var tl = gsap.timeline({ paused: true });\n            function setLayer(k, mode, local) {\n              var L = layers[k];\n              L.el.style.visibility = mode === \"hide\" ? \"hidden\" : \"visible\";\n              if (mode === \"hide\") return;\n              for (var i = 0; i < L.units.length; i++) {\n                var y = 0;\n                if (mode === \"exit\") y = -120 * sp.at(local - L.delays[i]);\n                else if (mode === \"enter\") y = 100 * (1 - sp.at(local - L.delays[i]));\n                L.units[i].style.transform = \"translateY(\" + y.toFixed(3) + \"%)\";\n              }\n            }\n            function draw(t) {\n              var idx = Math.floor(t / interval + 1e-9), local = t - idx * interval;\n              var cur = idx % n, prev = (idx - 1 + n) % n;\n              var wCur = widthOf(cur), width = wCur;\n              for (var k = 0; k < n; k++) if (k !== cur && k !== prev) setLayer(k, \"hide\", 0);\n              if (idx === 0 || n === 1) { setLayer(cur, \"static\", 0); if (prev !== cur) setLayer(prev, \"hide\", 0); }\n              else {\n                var exitEnd = maxDelay(prev) + sp.duration;\n                if (local < exitEnd) { setLayer(prev, \"exit\", local); setLayer(cur, \"hide\", 0); width = widthOf(prev); }\n                else {\n                  setLayer(prev, \"hide\", 0); setLayer(cur, \"enter\", local - exitEnd);\n                  var wPrev = widthOf(prev); width = wPrev + (wCur - wPrev) * sp.at(local - exitEnd);\n                }\n              }\n              pill.style.width = width.toFixed(2) + \"px\";\n            }\n\n            var clock = { t: 0 };\n            tl.to(clock, { t: D, duration: D, ease: \"none\", onUpdate: function () { draw(clock.t); } }, 0);\n            draw(0);\n            tl.seek(0);\n            window.__timelines = window.__timelines || {};\n            window.__timelines[\"text-rotate\"] = tl;\n\n          })();\n        </script>\n      </div>\n    </template>\n  </body>\n</html>\n"
  }
 ],
